<h2 id="general-commands-and-options">General commands and options</h2>
<p>The <code>version</code> command returns Genymotion Desktop version and revision number:</p>
<div class="admonition example">
<p class="admonition-title">Example</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre id="__code_4"><span></span><nav class="md-code__nav"><button class="md-code__button" title="Copy to clipboard" data-clipboard-target="#__code_4 &gt; code" data-md-type="copy"></button></nav><code>$<span class="w"> </span>./gmtool<span class="w"> </span>version
Version<span class="w">  </span>:<span class="w"> </span><span class="m">3</span>.3.2
Revision<span class="w"> </span>:<span class="w"> </span><span class="m">20221202</span>-872c52ef45
</code></pre></div>
</div>
<p>Global options are:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>--timeout/-t</code>: Timeout duration in seconds. Available range is <code>0-3600</code>.</li>
<li><code>--verbose/-v</code>: Verbose mode.</li>
<li><code>--help/-h</code>: Displays help on commandline options.</li>
</ul>
<div class="admonition example">
<p class="admonition-title">Example</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre id="__code_5"><span></span><nav class="md-code__nav"><button class="md-code__button" title="Copy to clipboard" data-clipboard-target="#__code_5 &gt; code" data-md-type="copy"></button></nav><code>$<span class="w"> </span>./gmtool<span class="w"> </span>admin<span class="w"> </span>-h
