<td>A wrong parameter value has been entered.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>3</td>
<td>The command has failed.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>4</td>
<td>The virtualization engine does not respond.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>5</td>
