</tr>
<tr>
<td>6</td>
<td>Unable to sign in.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>7</td>
<td>Unable to register the license key.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>8</td>
<td>Unable to activate the license.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>9</td>
<td>The license has not been activated.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>10</td>
<td>The license key is invalid.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
